           Spotify\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          \n          <li className=\"group relative flex items-center justify-center w-20 transition-all duration-500 hover32\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full\">\n              <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6728a3e6f4f4161c235bc519/6728a6bea73fcc6ee568f6f0_webflow.png\" alt=\"Webflow app icon\" className=\"w-full object-contain\" />\n            </a>\n            <div className=\"absolute top-0 transform -translate-y-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 text-sm rounded py-1 px-2 opacity-0 group-hover100 transition-all duration-500\">\n              Webflow\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          \n          <li className=\"group relative flex items-center justify-center w-20 transition-all duration-500 hover32\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full\">\n              <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6728a3e6f4f4161c235bc519/6728a6bdf9d004f8a9cf3b09_adobe-illustrator.png\" alt=\"Adobe Illustrator app icon\" className=\"w-full object-contain\" />\n            </a>\n            <div className=\"absolute top-0 transform -translate-y-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 text-sm rounded py-1 px-2 opacity-0 group-hover100 transition-all duration-500\">\n              Adobe Illustrator\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          \n          <li className=\"group relative flex items-center justify-center w-20 transition-all duration-500 hover32\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full\">\n              <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6728a3e6f4f4161c235bc519/6728a6be1de916069b5e1aaa_figma.png\" alt=\"Figma app icon\" className=\"w-full object-contain\" />\n            </a>\n            <div className=\"absolute top-0 transform -translate-y-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 text-sm rounded py-1 px-2 opacity-0 group-hover100 transition-all duration-500\">\n              Figma\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          \n          <li className=\"group relative flex items-center justify-center w-20 transition-all duration-500 hover32\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full\">\n              <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6728a3e6f4f4161c235bc519/6728a6be1de916069b5e1a86_adobe-photoshop.png\" alt=\"Photoshop app icon\" className=\"w-full object-contain\" />\n            </a>\n            <div className=\"absolute top-0 transform -translate-y-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 text-sm rounded py-1 px-2 opacity-0 group-hover100 transition-all duration-500\">\n              Photoshop\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          \n          <li className=\"group relative flex items-center justify-center w-20 transition-all duration-500 hover32\">\n            <a href=\"#\" className=\"pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full\">\n              <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6728a3e6f4f4161c235bc519/6728a6be051d32942a7aa31e_adobe-premierepro.png\" alt=\"Premiere Pro app icon\" className=\"w-full object-contain\" />\n            </a>\n            <div className=\"absolute top-0 transform -translate-y-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 text-sm rounded py-1 px-2 opacity-0 group-hover100 transition-all duration-500\">\n              Premiere Pro\n            </div>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </body>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
